# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# P0912_ECOMMERCE — .gitignore
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# --- Bytecode e caches Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# --- Distribuição / empacotamento ---
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# --- Ambientes virtuais ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version.local

# --- Arquivos de configuração local (NÃO versionar) ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# --- Banco de dados SQLite (artefato de runtime) ---
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Logs e dados de runtime ---
logs/
*.log
data/
uploads/

# --- Caches de ferramentas de teste e qualidade ---
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.cache/

# --- IDEs e editores ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
